### Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client extension). Env: "local".
@api = http://localhost:8000
@mp = http://localhost:8100

### Checkout: 3 installments
# @name checkout
POST {{api}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: try-me-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "guest_id": "guest_42",
  "listing_id": "listing_7",
  "check_in": "{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 60 d}}",
  "total_amount": 120000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "installments": 3,
  "cancellation_policy": "moderate",
  "payment_method": "pm_card_ok"
}

### Plan for the reservation above
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{checkout.response.body.reservation_id}}/plan

### Payment history
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{checkout.response.body.reservation_id}}/payments?limit=50

### Cancel (refund computed from policy)
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{checkout.response.body.reservation_id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Update the card (reschedules failed/abandoned installments; 409 if cancelled or a charge is in flight)
PUT {{api}}/reservations/{{checkout.response.body.reservation_id}}/payment-method
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payment_method": "pm_card_ok" }

### Payment methods: pm_card_ok | pm_card_insufficient_funds | pm_card_closed | pm_card_expired
###                  pm_card_stolen | pm_card_do_not_honor | pm_card_processing_error | pm_card_soft_then_ok

### MockPay: inject faults
POST {{mp}}/admin/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{ "webhook_drop_rate": 0.2, "webhook_reorder": true, "timeout_rate": 0.05, "settlement_rounding": true }

### MockPay: clear faults
POST {{mp}}/admin/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{ "webhook_drop_rate": 0, "webhook_reorder": false, "timeout_rate": 0, "settlement_rounding": false }

### MockPay: what happened to webhooks
GET {{mp}}/admin/deliveries

### Reconciliation: run for today, then read report
POST {{api}}/admin/reconciliation/{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}/run

###
GET {{api}}/admin/reconciliation/{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}
